WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:02.867
Mo watched Cora swim away.

2
00:00:02.868 --> 00:00:07.400
He didn't like lobsters or fishermen.

3
00:00:07.401 --> 00:00:10.133
But he wanted to be brave like Cora.

4
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:14.123
"I'm coming!" he called.

5
00:00:14.124 --> 00:00:19.100
Cora and Mo followed the arrow.

6
00:00:19.101 --> 00:00:26.563
They swam past some tall rocks.

7
00:00:26.564 --> 00:00:29.101
Mo stayed close to Cora.

8
00:00:29.102 --> 00:00:32.486
Suddenly something popped out of the sand.

9
00:00:32.487 --> 00:00:36.314
"Aah!" Mo hid behind Cora.

10
00:00:36.315 --> 00:00:41.820
Cora laughed. "Silly Mo.

11
00:00:41.821 --> 00:00:48.031
It's just a clam. Relax."

12
00:00:48.032 --> 00:00:53.228
"I'm always so nervous," Mo thought.

13
00:00:53.229 --> 00:00:59.359
Soon the arrow stopped.

14
00:00:59.360 --> 00:01:04.002
"There's the trap—and the lobsters," Cora said.

15
00:01:04.003 --> 00:01:08.313
"Help!" the lobsters cried.

16
00:01:08.314 --> 00:01:15.827
Mo gulped. "That trap looks really strong."

17
00:01:15.828 --> 00:01:18.580
Cora shook the trap gently.

18
00:01:18.581 --> 00:01:22.116
She tried to cut its wire bars.

19
00:01:22.117 --> 00:01:25.718
"This trap is strong," Cora said.

20
00:01:25.719 --> 00:01:29.530
"How will we open it?" Mo asked.

21
00:01:29.531 --> 00:01:35.818
Cora swam around the trap.

22
00:01:35.819 --> 00:01:39.472
"Look, there's an opening," she said.

23
00:01:39.473 --> 00:01:43.680
"Maybe I can pull the lobsters out."

24
00:01:43.681 --> 00:01:46.303
Cora reached into the trap.

25
00:01:46.304 --> 00:01:49.165
"Be careful," Mo said.

26
00:01:49.166 --> 00:01:52.848
"There are lots of nets inside."

27
00:01:52.849 --> 00:01:57.213
"Almost there," Cora said.

28
00:01:57.214 --> 00:02:01.576
She gently grabbed a lobster.

29
00:02:01.577 --> 00:02:05.896
She tried to pull her arm out.

30
00:02:05.897 --> 00:02:08.602
"Uh-oh," Cora said.

31
00:02:08.603 --> 00:02:12.247
"My arm is caught!"

